# Known-good SHA-256 of official BTicino firmware images.
#
# The repository never ships firmware. These are checksums so you can verify
# an image you obtained yourself before building a rooted version from it.
# Verify with:   sha256sum -c known-good.sha256   (run it next to your .fwz)
#
# Active, supported (Classe 300X):
